# Browser-check output — regenerated by `npm run e2e`, never reviewed as source.
#
# The visual baselines are deliberately not committed. Playwright renders them with the platform's
# own fonts, so a set generated on Windows fails on Linux for reasons that have nothing to do with
# the code. The first run on a machine writes them; every run after that diffs against them, which
# is what catches a change nobody was looking for.
e2e/screens.spec.ts-snapshots/
e2e/screenshots/
test-results/
playwright-report/
